    <string>Do these three things on both computers.</string>
   </property>
   <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="verticalLayout_checklist">
    <item>
     <widget class="QLabel" name="label_checklist">
      <property name="text">
       <string>1. Connect both computers to the same trusted network.

2. Install the same app version on both computers and keep security enabled on both.

3. On the main computer, arrange the other computer beside it using Arrange Computers.

If connecting fails, the status bar will explain what to check.</string>
      </property>
